                <pb facs="0596" n="588" sameAs="frus:frus1938v02/pg588"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">865.42/37: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Phillips</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-08-03T17:00:00+01:00">August 3, 1938—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received August 3—2:30 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>192. The following announcement was published in the press today: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Beginning with the 1938–39 scholastic year the admission to Italian
                            schools of all grades of foreign Jewish pupils even of those domiciled
                            in Italy is prohibited.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
